{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Bartender&f: &fAh! You look like someone strong.
&e[NPC] Bartender&f: &fThese are trying times, indeed. The &cGraveyard &fup ahead is overflowing with monsters! Anyone who comes in is spooked off by the grunts of Zombies in the distance.
